[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9481.429, "timestamp": "02:38:01", "text": "时间。当时也是在一次合作中。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9484.309, "timestamp": "02:38:04", "text": "我觉得是和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9487.51, "timestamp": "02:38:07", "text": "我相信。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9493.75, "timestamp": "02:38:13", "text": "嗯，当时我正在参加电话会议。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9497.83, "timestamp": "02:38:17", "text": "我听到这个消息时，我的天哪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9500.95, "timestamp": "02:38:20", "text": "我在这里速通所有内容，所以我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9503.99, "timestamp": "02:38:23", "text": "可以平静地离开，享受平静"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9508.87, "timestamp": "02:38:28", "text": "下个月我就会想，哇，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9511.99, "timestamp": "02:38:31", "text": "意思是说，我有机会延长"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9518.79, "timestamp": "02:38:38", "text": "Jakatan 一年 11 个月的鸡蛋。哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9521.03, "timestamp": "02:38:41", "text": "我的意思是，它既有优点也有缺点，两者兼而有之。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9523.39, "timestamp": "02:38:43", "text": "双方。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9525.59, "timestamp": "02:38:45", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9529.27, "timestamp": "02:38:49", "text": "就此争论一番。是的。但从某种意义上说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9531.349, "timestamp": "02:38:51", "text": "学院那边的人说，好的，我们会给的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9533.429, "timestamp": "02:38:53", "text": "您将获得补偿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9536.15, "timestamp": "02:38:56", "text": "例如，以N4课程的形式将是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9539.11, "timestamp": "02:38:59", "text": "自由的。嗯"}]